# Workers static assets redirects (same syntax as the old Pages _redirects).
#
# The site builds with base=/ai-engineering/ (its mount path on the hub domain),
# but Astro emits files at the dist root. So: send the bare root to the
# canonical base path, normalize the slashless base path, and rewrite (200, no
# redirect) base-prefixed URLs onto the real asset paths. Scaffold-emitted
# links that ignore the base (upstream bug, filed consumer:guides) resolve
# directly against the dist root, so both link shapes work standalone.
/ /ai-engineering/ 302
/ai-engineering /ai-engineering/ 302
/ai-engineering/* /:splat 200
